# Corpus tiers -- 5.3GB of PG-19 text. Rebuild with:
#   python build_corpus.py --tiers "64MB,256MB,1GB,4GB" --out ./corpus/
# The .meta.json sidecars ARE tracked, so a rebuilt corpus can be verified
# byte-for-byte against the sha256 that produced the published results.
corpus/*.txt

